OL,3,AJensen Huang reinstated as Nvidia CEO,
OL,4,Aboard says
OL,5,
OL,6,FJensen Huang has been reinstated as the
OL,7,FCEO and president of Nvidia, its board
OL,8,Fsays
OL,10,FHe stepped down earlier this month,
OL,11,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman
OL,12,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -
OL,13,Fhe was also accused of an affair with
OL,14,Fan Nvidia executive
OL,16,FThe board "voted unanimously" to
OL,17,Freinstate him, "following a series of
OL,18,Fdiscussions and meetings with Mr Huang,
OL,19,Fafter which the board was satisfied
OL,20,Fwith respect to Mr Huang's candor and
OL,21,Fability to lead Nvidia", the company
OL,22,Fsays
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
