OL,3,AJensen Huang reinstated as Nvidia CEO,
OL,4,Aboard says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe statement adds: "The board received
OL,7,Finput from senior levels of the United
OL,8,FStates government, and based on that
OL,9,Finput, the board is confident that Mr
OL,10,FHuang's reinstatement poses no national
OL,11,Fsecurity risk"
OL,13,FDonald Trump says Nvidia has made the
OL,14,F"the correct and proper decision",
OL,15,Fadding the government "has no reason to
OL,16,Fbelieve that Jensen's return to Nvidia
OL,17,Fposes any risk to national security"
OL,19,FHuang says: "I take this responsibility
OL,20,Fwith the greatest humility and renewed
OL,21,Fcommitment"
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
